{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a place in Albuquerque, New Mexico, USA, a strange accident occurred on October 27, 1986. Everything was recorded on a VHS tape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the eerie world of Backrooms Level X, a first-person horror game that immerses you in an endless labyrinth of desolate and surreal spaces. After a freak accident, you find yourself trapped in the Backrooms, a place where logic and reality vanish.  Explore endless corridors of yellow carpet, empty rooms and areas of flickering light as you try to find a way out. But beware: you are not alone. Mysterious entities lurk in the shadows, and every sound may be the last you hear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Navigate an immersive environment made with unique level design. Discover hidden secrets and an immersive narrative that will draw you into the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Immerse yourself in an oppressive atmosphere with immersive sound effects and haunting graphics that will keep you on the edge of your seat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges and Puzzles:</strong> Solve riddles and face challenges that will test your wits as you try to escape from the Backrooms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Environments:</strong> Backrooms Level X consists of more than 13 levels to explore. Discover the intricacies of the story and enemies, keeping each game a fresh and exciting experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defiant Bosses:</strong> Get out unscathed from huge final enemies. Throughout the exploration, we will encounter gigantic bosses that we will have to defeat with our wits. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive in the Backrooms? The only way out is to face your fears and discover the truth behind this terrifying place. Download Backrooms Level X and begin your journey into the unknown! </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The gap in the door...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/9d69ed903cef0a009920bf8ebd3ca26e8e133584.jpg"},{"name":"Longlegs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/70acb875435ba9f8fe1866942d595f37250999fc.jpg"},{"name":"You're a big guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/680f90d00bb0e8d1facb9300a9aacc412f93c8b2.jpg"},{"name":"Quackery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/a442ddf57374a781128328a91b7cd0ec9849910b.jpg"},{"name":"Subliminal Space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/af6cfcb99fa253b145de006b92ae327ac6afadb4.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta Go Fast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/edaf50ee95c87985b0fc1afed584c9bfa194fc30.jpg"},{"name":"D\u00e9j\u00e0 vu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/1bd85d80f4dffdb38e37cf52954b7bf82d63fbeb.jpg"},{"name":"Quantum Quackery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/f34ba9a61c91364b08496ea726832718805f477c.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/7d37f96732a89a08c0e9e6915be1de8bb5495344.jpg"},{"name":"Pawns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303230/c49837e16cfabcba9726b428f3b63b59eaeb7c83.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3303230?t=1759310998","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759310998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta